! Change request CHG-AC6-0001: retire the stale BGP advertisements on r4.
! Add `no network <prefix>` lines under address-family ipv4 for the prefixes to retire.
! Only r4's BGP advertisements are in scope for this change.
router bgp 65004
   address-family ipv4
   no network 10.20.30.0/24
   no network 10.20.40.0/24
